It's not over yet.

543
00:48:01,384 --> 00:48:02,385
There's still one person left.

544
00:49:43,910 --> 00:49:44,911
I'll be waiting for you.

545
00:50:26,720 --> 00:50:27,721
I'm here to turn myself in.

546
00:50:58,363 --> 00:50:59,920
Phat made the right decision, sweetheart.

547
00:51:10,760 --> 00:51:11,761
[Two Months Later]

548
00:51:48,054 --> 00:51:51,520
Master Tim was prosecuted for assaulting Muk,

549
00:51:51,555 --> 00:51:53,120
resulting in her death.

550
00:51:53,504 --> 00:51:55,560
His lawyer tried to plead insanity,

551
00:51:55,710 --> 00:51:59,100
but the evidence on Muk's phone and other evidence was overwhelming.

552
00:52:00,120 --> 00:52:03,600
In the end, Master Tim was sentenced to life in prison.

553
00:52:04,220 --> 00:52:07,721
But what hurt Master Tim, once a master of traditional Thai massage,

554
00:52:08,648 --> 00:52:10,680
the most was...

555
00:52:17,539 --> 00:52:18,640
Want me to give you a massage?

556
00:52:19,896 --> 00:52:20,920
Stay the hell away from me!

557
00:52:31,700 --> 00:52:32,720
Want me to give you a massage?

558
00:52:33,701 --> 00:52:37,520
I heard you're a master of massage.

559
00:52:38,566 --> 00:52:39,680
You know who I am?

560
00:52:40,448 --> 00:52:42,600
Yeah, I can give you a massage.

561
00:52:43,600 --> 00:52:45,720
I heard you used to charge hundreds of thousands an hour.

562
00:52:46,262 --> 00:52:47,640
This time, I'm doing it for free.

563
00:52:48,246 --> 00:52:51,040
But your hands are useless. How are you gonna massage me?

564
00:52:51,558 --> 00:52:52,559
I can do it.

565
00:52:53,051 --> 00:52:54,960
- Really?
- Really.

566
00:52:56,152 --> 00:52:57,153
Give it a try.

567
00:52:58,339 --> 00:52:59,960
- Just relax.
- Yeah.

568
00:53:00,638 --> 00:53:02,760
Don't be scared. Take it easy.

569
00:53:03,320 --> 00:53:04,421
I'll give you a massage.

570
00:53:04,536 --> 00:53:06,555
- Go easy on me!
- I'll be gentle.

571
00:53:10,454 --> 00:53:11,455
How's that?

572
00:53:12,374 --> 00:53:14,500
- Feel good?
- Yeah, not bad.

573
00:53:14,539 --> 00:53:15,680
Good.

574
00:53:17,139 --> 00:53:18,140
Good.

575
00:53:18,275 --> 00:53:19,276
Feels good, huh?

576
00:53:26,700 --> 00:53:27,701
That hurts, damn it!

577
00:53:28,091 --> 00:53:29,480
Are you trying to kill me?

578
00:53:29,632 --> 00:53:31,600
How did you know? You're not supposed to know!

579
00:53:31,904 --> 00:53:34,160
You're not supposed to know I'm using the deadly massage technique!

580
00:53:34,331 --> 00:53:35,680
You're not even supposed to feel any pain!

581
00:53:36,187 --> 00:53:37,640
- Let me try again!
- Stay away from me!

582
00:53:37,800 --> 00:53:39,000
Don't come any closer!

583
00:54:04,115 --> 00:54:07,160
- Wan, prepare some bone-healing medicine for me.
- Yes, Dad.

584
00:54:07,200 --> 00:54:08,201
Right away.

585
00:54:10,635 --> 00:54:13,250
As for me, things turned out just as my father had warned.

586
00:54:13,936 --> 00:54:16,920
As a healer, never use your knowledge to harm others.

587
00:54:17,779 --> 00:54:20,080
In the end, I could no longer do what I loved.

588
00:54:23,624 --> 00:54:25,360
My license was revoked.

589
00:54:25,715 --> 00:54:27,880
I could no longer practice the massage therapy I loved so much.

590
00:54:29,048 --> 00:54:30,640
But even if I wanted to keep practicing massage therapy,

591
00:54:31,032 --> 00:54:32,200
I wouldn't be able to anyway.

592
00:54:34,592 --> 00:54:37,320
As for Phat, he confessed

593
00:54:37,422 --> 00:54:39,250
and cooperated with the authorities in every case.

594
00:54:39,747 --> 00:54:42,520
The court showed leniency and reduced his sentence

595
00:54:42,808 --> 00:54:44,500
from the death penalty to life imprisonment.

596
00:54:46,603 --> 00:54:50,040
Every wrongdoing comes at a price.

597
00:54:51,574 --> 00:54:52,575
Losing my chance to be a healer

598
00:54:53,526 --> 00:54:55,760
was the price I paid for seeking revenge.

599
00:54:57,142 --> 00:54:58,240
If imprisonment

600
00:54:58,762 --> 00:55:01,160
was the price he had to pay for taking lives,

601
00:55:02,827 --> 00:55:04,128
then having to wait for him

602
00:55:04,944 --> 00:55:07,360
was another price I had to pay.

603
00:55:29,478 --> 00:55:30,479
Hey, you.

604
00:55:38,400 --> 00:55:39,401
How was your day?

605
00:55:41,731 --> 00:55:42,732
Better.

606
00:55:44,392 --> 00:55:46,440
My lower back hurts a little, though.

607
00:55:46,974 --> 00:55:47,975
Your lower back hurts?

608
00:55:50,771 --> 00:55:53,700
I wish I could give you a massage.

609
00:55:58,526 --> 00:56:00,280
Want to try a few simple stretches on your own?

610
00:56:01,926 --> 00:56:05,080
Sit like this and put your legs together.

611
00:56:05,880 --> 00:56:06,881
- Like this?
- Mm-hmm.

612
00:56:07,360 --> 00:56:08,520
Then place your hands on your knees.

613
00:56:11,638 --> 00:56:12,800
Slide them down your legs.

614
00:56:15,013 --> 00:56:16,600
- Like this?
- Mm-hmm. Bend forward.

615
00:56:16,700 --> 00:56:17,701
Like this.

616
00:56:19,038 --> 00:56:20,960
Or you can try another stretch. Sit up straight again.

617
00:56:21,144 --> 00:56:22,480
Spread your legs a little.

618
00:56:23,278 --> 00:56:24,360
Then bend forward

619
00:56:25,054 --> 00:56:27,520
like before, and twist your body to the left.

620
00:56:28,427 --> 00:56:30,160
- Like this?
- Yeah, to the left.

621
00:56:30,502 --> 00:56:31,503
Bend down a little further.

622
00:56:31,579 --> 00:56:32,640
- Like this?
- Yeah.

623
00:56:33,179 --> 00:56:35,334
- And if your shoulders hurt...
- Your shoulders hurt too?

624
00:56:35,995 --> 00:56:37,700
You can position your hand like this.

625
00:56:39,243 --> 00:56:41,000
Then press down on your shoulder.

626
00:56:45,243 --> 00:56:47,100
What if my hand hurts? What should I do?

627
00:56:47,267 --> 00:56:49,600
Use your thumb to press right here.

628
00:56:50,606 --> 00:56:52,000
- Like this?
- Yes.

629
00:56:52,286 --> 00:56:54,200
Press down, then slide it down to here.

630
00:56:59,208 --> 00:57:00,680
If pressing here makes the pain go away,

631
00:57:00,968 --> 00:57:03,240
where should I press to make the longing go away?

632
00:57:09,424 --> 00:57:10,480
Look at you, making jokes now.

633
00:57:13,478 --> 00:57:14,479
I've been thinking about that one all day.

634
00:57:14,609 --> 00:57:15,610
All day?

635
00:57:26,672 --> 00:57:27,880
But I really do miss you.

636
00:57:29,419 --> 00:57:30,420
I miss you too.

637
00:57:59,640 --> 00:58:01,641
[The End]
